# Tokyo Night Storm color scheme for KDE / KF6 apps (Dolphin, Ark, Gwenview…).
#
# Why this file exists: qt6ct sets the Qt *palette* for generic Qt apps, but KDE
# apps build their colors from KColorScheme, which reads kdeglobals. With no
# kdeglobals present, KColorScheme falls back to its built-in Breeze *Light*
# scheme and overrides qt6ct entirely — so Dolphin opens light. This provides the
# dark palette KDE apps actually read.
#
# Palette mirrors config/kitty/themes/tokyonight/tokyonight_storm.conf — keep in
# sync with it (and the Sway/Waybar Tokyo Night Storm colors).

